WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
Speaker 1: I have an update today to start with&nbsp;
about an investigation that many of you have been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:11.440
asking about going all the way back to at least&nbsp;
March of 2021, although maybe further, I remember&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:16.560
certainly talking about it in March of 2021.&nbsp;
We've known that Republican Congressman Matt&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.280
Gaetz has been under investigation for a number&nbsp;
of different possible crimes, including sex&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:28.400
trafficking of underage girls, and he lawyered up&nbsp;
with some of the best sex crime defense attorneys&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:35.600
in the in the country. Quite frankly, we've been&nbsp;
expecting crimes to be charged at some point and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.800
then nothing has happened, and many of you have&nbsp;
written to me and said, David, what's going on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:44.320
now? Of course, I know nothing other than what is&nbsp;
reported. But we have a new report from the middle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:52.880
of this week that Matt Gaetz ex-girlfriend,&nbsp;
has testified to a grand jury in the sex&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.880 --> 00:01:00.480
trafficking probe, suggesting that by all&nbsp;
measures, we are getting closer to actual charges&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:05.840
against Matt Gaetz. No guarantee, but listen&nbsp;
to this report from NBC Congressman Matt Gaetz,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:10.960
ex-girlfriend testified Wednesday before a federal&nbsp;
grand jury investigating him for sex crimes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.880
a major development that suggests the DOJ may be&nbsp;
moving closer to indicting him. The ex-girlfriend,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:20.880
whose name is being withheld to respect their&nbsp;
privacy, has been in talks for months with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:25.600
prosecutors about an immunity deal. Can you&nbsp;
imagine his ex-girlfriend may be liable for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:30.800
criminality and wants immunity under a possible&nbsp;
deal? She would avoid prosecution for obstruction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:37.760
of justice in return for testifying in the&nbsp;
investigation into whether Gates in 2017 had sex&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:45.120
with a 17 year old female for money, and whether&nbsp;
months later he and others violated a federal law&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:51.520
prohibiting people from transporting others&nbsp;
across state lines to engage in prostitution.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:58.480
Legal sources familiar with the case say Gates&nbsp;
is being investigated for three distinct crimes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:04.960
Sex trafficking the 17 year old violating the Mann&nbsp;
Act, which prohibits taking women across state&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:11.120
lines for prostitution and obstructing police&nbsp;
obstructing justice. Importantly, Gates has not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:16.320
been charged with a crime. Gates has denied all&nbsp;
accusations, saying he never paid for sex. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:22.480
never had sex with a minor when he was an adult.&nbsp;
He has called the investigation a witch hunt.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:27.520
The attorney for Gates ex-girlfriend Tim&nbsp;
Jansen, declined to comment about the case&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:31.760
when he was spotted by a reporter entering&nbsp;
a courthouse in Orlando with the client. A&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:37.760
Department of Justice spokesman declined comment.&nbsp;
Gates did not respond to a request for comment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:43.440
The investigation has lasted more than a year.&nbsp;
It started when a former friend and ally of Gates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:48.480
tax collector Joel Greenberg, was charged with a&nbsp;
host of crimes from falsely smearing a political&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:54.480
rival as being a pedophile or pedophile to change&nbsp;
to cheating taxpayers in a cryptocurrency scheme&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:59.200
to sex trafficking. The same 17 year old girl&nbsp;
and Gates investigation. Greenberg has agreed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:07.440
to plead guilty and is cooperating with federal&nbsp;
investigators. An important aspect of the article&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:14.080
here is the serious nature of all of the things&nbsp;
Matt Gaetz is being investigated for. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:20.000
we don't know what's going to happen here. This&nbsp;
might lead to nothing. It's clearly not over,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:25.280
and it is Matt Gaetz own&nbsp;
ex-girlfriend who ultimately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.760
might provide the testimony or might provide&nbsp;
part of the testimony. We just don't know yet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:36.480
That leads to very serious charges against Matt&nbsp;
Gaetz. Now what about removing Matt Gaetz from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:43.440
House of Representatives if he is charged? You can&nbsp;
find a number of different commentaries on this.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:52.640
It is typical that if members of the House&nbsp;
are charged with felonies that they resign,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:59.280
they could be forced out. Although whether the&nbsp;
Republican Party would be interested in doing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:03.760
that, particularly if they take over the House&nbsp;
of Representatives before charges are brought.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:10.720
If they are, there's a lot of questions here,&nbsp;
but very, very serious charges. It's not over.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:17.360
Will he eventually be charged? We just don't know.&nbsp;
But we could be just weeks away, and I know we've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:22.160
been saying that for a while. We could be weeks&nbsp;
away from finding out the answer to that question

